@startuml
title verify email

actor Client
participant "Express Router" as Router
participant "AuthController\n(ctrl.verifyEmail)" as Ctrl
participant "AuthService\n(svc.verifyEmail)" as Svc
database "MongoDB" as DB

Client -> Router: GET /verify-email?token=...&account=...
Router -> Ctrl: ctrl.verifyEmail(req, res)
Ctrl -> Ctrl: token = body.token || query.token\naccountId = body.account_id || query.account
Ctrl -> Svc: verifyEmail({ token, accountId })

Svc -> DB: EmailVerification.find(accountId,\n used:false, expires_at > now)\n.sort(_id:-1).limit(10)
DB --> Svc: recs (list)

Svc -> Svc: tìm bản ghi matched bằng so khớp token_hash

Svc -> DB: Account.findByIdAndUpdate(matched.account_id,\n set email_verified = true)

Svc -> DB: matched.used = true; matched.used_at = now; matched.save()

Svc --> Ctrl: { ok: true }
Ctrl --> Client: 200 JSON { ok: true }

@enduml
